---
description: Motion and interaction design
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.css"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Motion should feel soft, subtle, and playful.

Prefer:
- gentle fades
- small transforms
- subtle hover reactions
- occasional character animations

Avoid:
- excessive motion
- dramatic transitions
- constant movement
- animation purely for decoration

The site should feel calm when the user isn't interacting with it.